    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d5">

                <pb facs="0031" n="19" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v4/pg19"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Record of the proceedings of the tribunal of
                        arbitration at the fourth conference held at Geneva, in Switzerland, on
                        the</hi> 17<hi rendition="#italic">th day of June</hi>, 1872.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName>Geneva, Switzerland</placeName>,
                            <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1872-06-17">June 17, 1872</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The conference was held pursuant to adjournment. All the arbitrators were
                    present.</p>
                <p><seg type="margin">Adjournment.</seg> Mr. J. C. Bancroft Davis and Lord Tenterden
                    attended the conference as agents of the United States and Her Britannic
                    Majesty, respectively.</p>
                <p>The protocol of the last conference was read and approved, and was signed by the
                    president and secretary of the tribunal and the agents of the two
                    governments.</p>
                <p>Mr. Bancroft Davis stated that he was still without definite instructions from
                    his Government regarding the request of the British agent for adjournment, and
                    suggested a further adjournment of the tribunal until Wednesday, the nineteenth
                    instant.</p>
                <p>Lord Tenterden said that he could make no objection. The conference was then
                    adjourned to Wednesday, the 19th instant, at 2 o’clock.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>FREDERICK SCLOPIS.</item>
                            <item>J. C. BANCROFT DAVIS.</item>
                            <item>TENTERDEN.</item>
                            <item>ALEX. FAVROT, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
